WEBVTT

00:02:57.089 --> 00:03:02.011
This exploration could teach us
so much more about life,

00:03:02.011 --> 00:03:04.388
in all its vast complexities.

00:03:06.515 --> 00:03:11.562
These ideas might sound
like mere science fiction,

00:03:11.604 --> 00:03:17.610
but my mission as an artist is to create
possibilities of other worlds,

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:21.072
and other ways of living and being,

00:03:21.113 --> 00:03:22.949
even if just for a moment.

00:03:24.825 --> 00:03:28.746
So when I was invited to imagine
a large-scale installation

00:03:28.746 --> 00:03:31.874
at the Tate Modern in London,